[G]Unite us [Em]in [D]the [G]sacred [Am]love [D7]Of [G]know[Em]ledge, [D]truth and [G]Thee;
And [C]let our [Am]hills [E7]and [Am]val[E7]leys [Am]shout [C]The [F#dim]songs [Em]of [G]liberty.

Verse 4
[G]Here may re[Em]li[D]gion, [G]pure and [Am]mild, [D7]Smile [G]on [Em]our [D]Sabbath [G]hours;
